(7026282, 1065552, 127021, '<td valign="top">while i like this image and i''ll give it a good score, i''d love to have seen it more bold and daring and have the leaf in a corner or somewhere strange, as if to be the accident on an image of white.  of course that''s just me, but still i''d like to see it. technically speaking i think you''ve done a great job.</td>', 'while i like this image and i''ll give it a good score, i''d love to have seen it more bold and daring and have the leaf in a corner or somewhere strange, as if to be the accident on an image of white.  of course that''s just me, but still i''d like to see it. technically speaking i think you''ve done a great job.', '2013-04-24 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
