(7026286, 1066611, 127021, '<td valign="top">I like this image quite a bit, i think it''s a touch underexposed and maybe a bit more contrast (a bit, really) could help.   The Idea this conveys is the important aspect of the image and you''ve done it well... so it''s one of my top picks</td>', 'I like this image quite a bit, i think it''s a touch underexposed and maybe a bit more contrast (a bit, really) could help.   The Idea this conveys is the important aspect of the image and you''ve done it well... so it''s one of my top picks', '2013-04-24 11:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
