(7028263, 1066625, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ottawa? I didn''t realize there were locks on one of the bridges. Haven''t walked over that particular bridge in a while.</td>', 'Ottawa? I didn''t realize there were locks on one of the bridges. Haven''t walked over that particular bridge in a while.', '2013-04-28 18:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028264, 1066663, 43774, '<td valign="top">Aren''t those spring flowers?</td>', 'Aren''t those spring flowers?', '2013-04-28 18:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028572, 1065942, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Stunning pales in comparison to the rich golds and oranges of the leaves! Great textures too - love the lattice like veins of the leaves. Great detail and bold colors that captures autumn very well! I think we will see this take a spot in the top three.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Stunning pales in comparison to the rich golds and oranges of the leaves! Great textures too - love the lattice like veins of the leaves. Great detail and bold colors that captures autumn very well! I think we will see this take a spot in the top three.', '2013-04-28 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028581, 1066328, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the golden hues of the autumn grasses. This capture has a lot of great details for the eye to drink in from the textures of the rocks in the foreground to the bending stalks of grass. I like the leading line of the creek that curves and bends then goes off to the horizon.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the golden hues of the autumn grasses. This capture has a lot of great details for the eye to drink in from the textures of the rocks in the foreground to the bending stalks of grass. I like the leading line of the creek that curves and bends then goes off to the horizon.', '2013-04-28 23:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028584, 1066387, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fine details captured here - love that you were able to capture the sweep of rain as it falls like a curtain just off to the left of the road. The dirt road acts as a leading line that draws our attention to and back on those brooding heavy clouds above.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fine details captured here - love that you were able to capture the sweep of rain as it falls like a curtain just off to the left of the road. The dirt road acts as a leading line that draws our attention to and back on those brooding heavy clouds above.', '2013-04-28 23:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028589, 1066381, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Good eye! The autumn leaf has <u>fall</u>en into the web the spider weaved. Love how the dewdrops of water showcases the latticework of the web.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Good eye! The autumn leaf has fallen into the web the spider weaved. Love how the dewdrops of water showcases the latticework of the web.', '2013-04-28 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028593, 1066212, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Nice capture of the leaves of autumn and the colors. The capture is good but I think it could be even better. There are just a bit too many leaves in the foreground to hold the eyes attention for the leaves in the midrange &amp; background call to the eye as well. It is a little hard to point to where the eye should rest as the solid main focal point. Perhaps just focusing on three of the leaves getting some nice sharp details with the rest in deep bokeh is one way it would have been better.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Nice capture of the leaves of autumn and the colors. The capture is good but I think it could be even better. There are just a bit too many leaves in the foreground to hold the eyes attention for the leaves in the midrange & background call to the eye as well. It is a little hard to point to where the eye should rest as the solid main focal point. Perhaps just focusing on three of the leaves getting some nice sharp details with the rest in deep bokeh is one way it would have been better.', '2013-04-28 23:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028597, 1066387, 136989, '<td valign="top">Fury indeed!  I love the balance f sun and storm.  Such deep yet vibrant colors. The road leading the way is a nice plus.  My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Fury indeed!  I love the balance f sun and storm.  Such deep yet vibrant colors. The road leading the way is a nice plus.  My favorite in the challenge.', '2013-04-28 23:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028599, 1066196, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great details on the underside of the mushroom. Wonder if there was a way to get more of that brilliant red topside into the frame for its a shame so little is shown? I think a closer zoom would allow the mushroom to shine more as the main subject. The leaves on the ground and the blade of green grass compete for the eyes attention.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great details on the underside of the mushroom. Wonder if there was a way to get more of that brilliant red topside into the frame for its a shame so little is shown? I think a closer zoom would allow the mushroom to shine more as the main subject. The leaves on the ground and the blade of green grass compete for the eyes attention.', '2013-04-28 23:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028723, 1066471, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>Fabulous capture of light as it bathes the slope of the mountain and the trees &amp; valley below. I have two critiques/suggestions that could improve the photo. First, there seems to be a bit of noise in the photo (looking at the shadow regions of the mountain the yellows and greens have some faint red noise) - a good denoise program can clean it up and give it a crisp, clean look. Second suggestion is shooting with a smaller aperture will increase the depth of field so that both your foreground and background will have nice sharp details. Would be nice if those trees had some nice sharp details to them.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment Fabulous capture of light as it bathes the slope of the mountain and the trees & valley below. I have two critiques/suggestions that could improve the photo. First, there seems to be a bit of noise in the photo (looking at the shadow regions of the mountain the yellows and greens have some faint red noise) - a good denoise program can clean it up and give it a crisp, clean look. Second suggestion is shooting with a smaller aperture will increase the depth of field so that both your foreground and background will have nice sharp details. Would be nice if those trees had some nice sharp details to them.', '2013-04-29 04:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028729, 1065552, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lighting shows off the dry autumn leaf in nice, crisp detail. The white backdrop gives the composition a rather stark and sterile environment though. The stark white does not complement the gold/brown hues with projecting/capturing the mood of autumn but it does show off the leaf with textbook detail. Well exposed and has great details I just think that it needs something more (different color backdrop with warm hues perhaps) to add to the composition.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lighting shows off the dry autumn leaf in nice, crisp detail. The white backdrop gives the composition a rather stark and sterile environment though. The stark white does not complement the gold/brown hues with projecting/capturing the mood of autumn but it does show off the leaf with textbook detail. Well exposed and has great details I just think that it needs something more (different color backdrop with warm hues perhaps) to add to the composition.', '2013-04-29 05:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028731, 1066405, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The lighting really shows off the great lattice like veins in those two leaves. You also captured some great bokeh in the backdrop for these two leaves to pop visually off of. My one big suggestion/critique is that take care when composing the shot - if you have to move a twig or small branch out of the way so that it does not distract from your main subject then it is best to do so. Shame that the twig cuts across the frame and across the red leaf drawing some of the eye''s attention away from those main subjects.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The lighting really shows off the great lattice like veins in those two leaves. You also captured some great bokeh in the backdrop for these two leaves to pop visually off of. My one big suggestion/critique is that take care when composing the shot - if you have to move a twig or small branch out of the way so that it does not distract from your main subject then it is best to do so. Shame that the twig cuts across the frame and across the red leaf drawing some of the eye''s attention away from those main subjects.', '2013-04-29 05:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028787, 1066328, 20799, '<td valign="top">I guess it is November somewhere :-). Beautiful depth in the darkness.<br/>One of two best titles in the challenge.</td>', 'I guess it is November somewhere :-). Beautiful depth in the darkness.One of two best titles in the challenge.', '2013-04-29 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028788, 1066517, 20799, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pinhole look. Brave colors keep my eye near the horizon and the mysterious tower.</td>', 'Wonderful pinhole look. Brave colors keep my eye near the horizon and the mysterious tower.', '2013-04-29 08:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028791, 1066561, 20799, '<td valign="top">Yes, my favorite. I can hear the song. A happy change is what the picture says, and I like that.<br/>One of two best titles in the challenge.</td>', 'Yes, my favorite. I can hear the song. A happy change is what the picture says, and I like that.One of two best titles in the challenge.', '2013-04-29 08:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028801, 1065560, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Isn''t it irksome that the cars have to park there on the street and ruin a clean leading line through those beautiful autumn tree canopy?:-P  The colors and canopy of the trees are beautiful - I wonder if there was a time of day where nature doesn''t have to share the road with the cars?:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Isn''t it irksome that the cars have to park there on the street and ruin a clean leading line through those beautiful autumn tree canopy?:-P  The colors and canopy of the trees are beautiful - I wonder if there was a time of day where nature doesn''t have to share the road with the cars?:-)', '2013-04-29 09:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028853, 1066611, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>You''ve captured some really nice details and textures seen in the withered rose. The ice crystals coating the rose does give me the feel of chill and cold in the air. But being honest, the ice and the white backdrop speaks <u>more strongly</u> of winter then of autumn. I have a feeling that many in your audience would classify this as an image that speaks more Winter than Fall. It''s a good strong composition that I feel would have shown better if the challenge had been Winter.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. You''ve captured some really nice details and textures seen in the withered rose. The ice crystals coating the rose does give me the feel of chill and cold in the air. But being honest, the ice and the white backdrop speaks more strongly of winter then of autumn. I have a feeling that many in your audience would classify this as an image that speaks more Winter than Fall. It''s a good strong composition that I feel would have shown better if the challenge had been Winter.', '2013-04-29 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
