(7029309, 1066328, 124982, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is most lovely! The texture and details in the rocks and grass is quite awesome. You''ve applied HDR to good effect here, without crossing the line which is easy to do on nature shots. Also, the yellow tones just scream Autumn. Top image of the challenge so far.</td>', 'Oh my, this is most lovely! The texture and details in the rocks and grass is quite awesome. You''ve applied HDR to good effect here, without crossing the line which is easy to do on nature shots. Also, the yellow tones just scream Autumn. Top image of the challenge so far.', '2013-04-29 21:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029310, 1066663, 124982, '<td valign="top">Personally, with all the blue flowers I would think this is more suited for the Spring challenge? I do like the composition and the detail in the foreground. Great DoF?</td>', 'Personally, with all the blue flowers I would think this is more suited for the Spring challenge? I do like the composition and the detail in the foreground. Great DoF?', '2013-04-29 21:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029311, 1065942, 124982, '<td valign="top">I seem to have seen a bunch of these kind of leaf shots lately. Regardless, this is quite beautiful. Great detail and lighting. Top 3 so far!</td>', 'I seem to have seen a bunch of these kind of leaf shots lately. Regardless, this is quite beautiful. Great detail and lighting. Top 3 so far!', '2013-04-29 21:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029314, 1066611, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very delicate, and quite lovely. Just love the tones and colors in this dying rose. Wish there was a smidge more detail in the snow encrusting the rose, but that''s a minor nit :)</td>', 'Very delicate, and quite lovely. Just love the tones and colors in this dying rose. Wish there was a smidge more detail in the snow encrusting the rose, but that''s a minor nit :)', '2013-04-29 21:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
