(7029949, 1066237, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very cool study of lines and shadows. The tree/bush branches are silhouettes that pop off the white snowy ground. The composition as it stands speaks more strongly of winter and not autumn. Perhaps if there was just one single leaf on the ground between the branches a strong visual connection to Autumn could be made.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very cool study of lines and shadows. The tree/bush branches are silhouettes that pop off the white snowy ground. The composition as it stands speaks more strongly of winter and not autumn. Perhaps if there was just one single leaf on the ground between the branches a strong visual connection to Autumn could be made.', '2013-04-30 20:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029965, 1066192, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow, now that is an interesting location. The statue dominates the scene with the bur tipped reeds seem to lean in towards it. This photo has a surreal/conceptual feel to it - the woman''s head with the closed eyes seems to be dreaming. The clouds can either be looked at as emanating from her or could be converging in on her. There are not many visual cues within the photo that speaks <b><u>strongly</u></b> Autumn or Fall to me. Perhaps if the color version had some colors that are associated with Autumn a connection could be made.</td>', 'Voted coming back to comment. Wow, now that is an interesting location. The statue dominates the scene with the bur tipped reeds seem to lean in towards it. This photo has a surreal/conceptual feel to it - the woman''s head with the closed eyes seems to be dreaming. The clouds can either be looked at as emanating from her or could be converging in on her. There are not many visual cues within the photo that speaks strongly Autumn or Fall to me. Perhaps if the color version had some colors that are associated with Autumn a connection could be made.', '2013-04-30 20:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029979, 1066328, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moody shot and great title. If it were not that the Bear is not currently experiencing autumn I would take this to be his. I predict a ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful moody shot and great title. If it were not that the Bear is not currently experiencing autumn I would take this to be his. I predict a ribbon.', '2013-04-30 21:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
