(7030471, 1066328, 42198, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this shot makes it very interesting - It''s difficult to judge how far away the stream is as there are no objects to compare against, but this adds to the surreal quality. Nice one!</td>', 'The perspective on this shot makes it very interesting - It''s difficult to judge how far away the stream is as there are no objects to compare against, but this adds to the surreal quality. Nice one!', '2013-05-01 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
