(7031308, 1066387, 109341, '<td valign="top">While I love the processing of the sky and clouds and think they make for a very dramatic and striking effect, I am not a fan of the bottom left of the image with over-saturated / tone mapped shrubbery.  I also don''t like the halo effect around the silhouettes of trees on the horizon.   Did not vote in this challenge, but would have probably given it a 6.  Regardless congrats on the blue and fantastically dramatic sky.</td>', 'While I love the processing of the sky and clouds and think they make for a very dramatic and striking effect, I am not a fan of the bottom left of the image with over-saturated / tone mapped shrubbery.  I also don''t like the halo effect around the silhouettes of trees on the horizon.   Did not vote in this challenge, but would have probably given it a 6.  Regardless congrats on the blue and fantastically dramatic sky.', '2013-05-03 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7031378, 1066328, 109341, '<td valign="top">This is very nice! I love the processing. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'This is very nice! I love the processing. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2013-05-03 07:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
